Name shadowing
Naming best practices
Objective
Learn how to use built-in functions and avoid accidentally hiding them with variable names.
Practice File
builtins_and_shadowing.py
Key Takeaway
Avoid using built-in names such as list, str, and sum as variable names because doing so can hide their original functionality.
